    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAPER'S ISLE</strong> is an open-world, stealth horror game created by a team of  students at UW-Stout and Berklee College of Music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You receive a concerning message from your daughter, a paleontologist stationed on a remote island. After making your way to the isle, you discover horrifying phantoms from the ancient world. Restore power across the map to gain access to the main laboratory where you\u2019ll discover the fate of your missing daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid phantom monsters while solving basic puzzles to restore power across the island at watchtowers. By hiding in bushes, or tall grass and moving carefully, you can avoid confrontation. Throw rocks to distract and maneuver skillfully around the phantoms. You must be cautious, as the phantoms will absorb your soul if they touch you, causing you to restart at your last checkpoint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the open world environment in first-person perspective. Study plants and creatures to uncover their mysterious origins and behavioral traits to help you survive. Discover logs and signs of former destruction to uncover secrets about the prior island's inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, after restoring power, venture into the lab in the island's depths where you\u2019ll discover the fate of your missing daughter.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REAPER'S ISLE</strong> is an open-world, stealth horror game created by a team of  students at UW-Stout and Berklee College of Music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You receive a concerning message from your daughter, a paleontologist stationed on a remote island. After making your way to the isle, you discover horrifying phantoms from the ancient world. Restore power across the map to gain access to the main laboratory where you\u2019ll discover the fate of your missing daughter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVADE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid phantom monsters while solving basic puzzles to restore power across the island at watchtowers. By hiding in bushes, or tall grass and moving carefully, you can avoid confrontation. Throw rocks to distract and maneuver skillfully around the phantoms. You must be cautious, as the phantoms will absorb your soul if they touch you, causing you to restart at your last checkpoint. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DISCOVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the open world environment in first-person perspective. Study plants and creatures to uncover their mysterious origins and behavioral traits to help you survive. Discover logs and signs of former destruction to uncover secrets about the prior island's inhabitants. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>UNCOVER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, after restoring power, venture into the lab in the island's depths where you\u2019ll discover the fate of your missing daughter.</p>",
    "short_description": "The ancient island beckons in this open-world, stealth horror game. Search for your missing daughter while avoiding dangerous phantom creatures. Restore power across the island to access the lab in the island's depths where you\u2019ll discover the fate of your missing daughter.",
